WEBVTT

01:33.330 --> 01:35.601
(Adapted from the web novel "Waiting for You in a City")

01:35.661 --> 01:37.961
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:38.030 --> 01:40.931
(Episode 35)

01:44.440 --> 01:46.371
Is someone bribing you?

01:47.470 --> 01:48.840
When did that happen?

01:49.241 --> 01:50.140
Just now.

01:52.651 --> 01:53.511
Have you seen...

01:54.720 --> 01:55.480
this person before?

01:55.551 --> 01:56.280
I haven't.

01:57.450 --> 01:59.621
You're not involved in the investigation.

02:00.621 --> 02:02.991
Someone is framing you...

02:03.420 --> 02:04.791
to get you involved.

02:06.390 --> 02:08.101
This is too low.

02:08.461 --> 02:09.301
Am I that stupid?

02:10.000 --> 02:10.801
This isn't a simple matter.

02:11.700 --> 02:12.771
This afternoon,

02:13.131 --> 02:14.970
the investigation team went to the construction site...

02:15.340 --> 02:17.271
and said the insulation materials...

02:17.340 --> 02:19.211
that were sealed at the site...

02:19.271 --> 02:20.671
were all grade B1.

02:21.010 --> 02:22.540
They meet all the criteria.

02:22.611 --> 02:23.510
That's impossible.

02:25.410 --> 02:26.981
First, they perpetrated fraud...

02:27.611 --> 02:28.720
and slacked off.

02:29.021 --> 02:30.921
Then they gave you this money.

02:31.451 --> 02:32.621
Something...

02:35.361 --> 02:36.760
is up.

02:37.461 --> 02:38.331
You should...

02:38.560 --> 02:39.461
give the money...

02:39.891 --> 02:40.991
to the disciplinary committee first.

03:24.970 --> 03:27.010
Are the CT scan results for Li Da Long in bed 15 out?

03:28.040 --> 03:28.981
His family won't allow it.

03:29.040 --> 03:30.440
They said it has already been done before.

03:30.510 --> 03:31.681
They won't listen no matter what.

03:48.130 --> 03:49.660
The hospital is telling us to pay again.

03:51.100 --> 03:53.000
The small amount of compensation is almost used up.

03:53.371 --> 03:54.701
And you still haven't recovered.

03:56.000 --> 03:57.070
If your boss...

03:57.440 --> 03:58.711
didn't do shoddy work...

03:58.771 --> 03:59.810
and used inferior material to save money,

04:00.211 --> 04:02.040
you wouldn't have been burned this way.

04:02.440 --> 04:03.810
Stop nagging.

04:04.810 --> 04:06.310
We took the money.

04:06.880 --> 04:08.181
We signed the deal.

04:09.320 --> 04:10.880
Why are you talking about this?

04:19.260 --> 04:19.961
Doctor.

04:20.891 --> 04:22.160
Why haven't you done the CT scan?

04:23.530 --> 04:24.700
We're not doing it.

04:25.101 --> 04:26.101
We're getting discharged...

04:26.400 --> 04:27.371
and resting at home.

04:27.431 --> 04:28.171
You want to be discharged?

04:28.940 --> 04:29.601
No.

04:29.801 --> 04:30.940
He can't be discharged now.

04:31.810 --> 04:32.940
He has rales in his lungs.

04:33.070 --> 04:34.940
I suspect it's a post-burn complication.

04:35.041 --> 04:36.580
Pulmonary edema or even sepsis.

04:36.640 --> 04:37.541
If he's not treated in time,

04:37.611 --> 04:39.010
it could be life-threatening.

04:41.111 --> 04:41.921
Doctor.

04:42.281 --> 04:45.051
You can't say that to scare us just because we're uneducated.

04:45.121 --> 04:46.291
It's the truth.

04:50.621 --> 04:51.531
It's up to you...

04:52.661 --> 04:53.591
if you want to do the examination or not.

04:53.690 --> 04:54.861
I've already made myself very clear.

04:55.500 --> 04:56.531
Think about it carefully.

05:07.841 --> 05:08.681
How are you feeling?

05:08.741 --> 05:13.450
(Party loyalty, strict discipline, defy danger and death)

05:15.681 --> 05:16.820
The team still decided...

05:17.121 --> 05:18.150
to suspend him temporarily.

05:18.820 --> 05:19.690
You'll have to oversee...

05:19.750 --> 05:20.921
the station's affairs for now.

05:21.091 --> 05:22.721
Are there any other alternatives?

05:25.531 --> 05:27.291
This is the best solution...

05:27.361 --> 05:28.260
after careful consideration.

05:28.361 --> 05:29.031
The best?

05:29.101 --> 05:30.601
Are you kidding me?

05:30.731 --> 05:31.570
The video...

05:31.801 --> 05:32.971
is obviously edited.

05:33.031 --> 05:34.371
Isn't he being framed?

05:34.700 --> 05:36.000
If you're going to do this and even suspend him,

05:36.440 --> 05:37.171
I quit.

05:37.241 --> 05:38.200
- Then we quit too. - Then we quit too.

05:38.611 --> 05:39.371
Instructor.

05:39.440 --> 05:40.341
How can he be suspended?

05:41.010 --> 05:42.380
The brigade has its own plans.

05:42.741 --> 05:43.611
We can only wait for updates.

05:43.810 --> 05:44.611
What update?

05:44.681 --> 05:45.351
We'll just quit.

05:45.411 --> 05:46.450
Can we still wait for news? Then...

05:46.510 --> 05:47.181
Shut up!

05:54.520 --> 05:55.921
Just do your jobs.

05:56.661 --> 05:57.760
Don't worry.

05:58.161 --> 05:58.890
Get to work.

06:01.531 --> 06:02.200
Go.

06:02.301 --> 06:03.060
Get to work.

06:04.601 --> 06:05.301
Okay.

06:05.601 --> 06:06.330
Let's get to work.

06:27.121 --> 06:28.221
You're suspended?

06:28.621 --> 06:29.560
Lower your voice.

06:29.960 --> 06:31.060
Your parents might hear you.

06:32.130 --> 06:33.361
Tell them I'm on leave.

06:33.931 --> 06:35.200
What's going on?

06:35.460 --> 06:36.630
I saw on the news...

06:36.700 --> 06:37.900
that Zhan Da Peng died.

06:37.960 --> 06:38.630
The cause of the fire...

06:38.700 --> 06:39.830
is still under investigation.

06:40.971 --> 06:42.200
It's quite complicated.

06:44.371 --> 06:45.770
Why did they suspend you?

06:45.841 --> 06:47.570
They're so unreasonable.

06:48.210 --> 06:50.010
I think you should find another job,

06:50.080 --> 06:51.810
so we won't have to worry about you.

06:53.851 --> 06:54.911
Even if I get fired,

06:55.580 --> 06:56.450
I'll get...

06:56.820 --> 06:57.921
to the bottom of this matter.

07:00.250 --> 07:01.051
Do you think...

07:01.890 --> 07:03.320
this was done by the Meng family?

07:04.121 --> 07:04.861
Don't spout nonsense.

07:08.460 --> 07:09.560
I'm not spouting nonsense.

07:09.760 --> 07:11.361
Have you forgotten what happened in the past?

07:11.801 --> 07:13.231
I won't talk about the medical checkup.

07:13.301 --> 07:13.971
When you were a soldier,

07:14.031 --> 07:15.741
you finally became an outstanding soldier...

07:15.801 --> 07:17.000
and got into the military academy.

07:17.341 --> 07:18.000
In the end,

07:18.070 --> 07:19.070
something happened...

07:19.140 --> 07:19.940
right before the evaluation.

07:20.341 --> 07:21.341
And now,

07:21.411 --> 07:22.810
this happened again.

07:22.940 --> 07:24.611
Don't you think your fates are surprisingly similar?

07:25.281 --> 07:26.010
Zhai Miao.

07:27.510 --> 07:28.981
Don't bring that up again.

07:30.351 --> 07:31.621
I don't want to bring that up.

07:31.690 --> 07:33.690
But will the Meng family let you off?

07:33.991 --> 07:34.650
By the way,

07:34.721 --> 07:35.890
do you really not care...

07:35.960 --> 07:37.460
about what happened in the past anymore?

07:44.560 --> 07:45.531
I told you.

07:45.731 --> 07:46.830
Don't bring up...

07:48.570 --> 07:49.341
the past.

07:50.371 --> 07:51.270
This matter...

07:51.541 --> 07:52.940
may be related to Guokun,

07:54.140 --> 07:56.241
but it has nothing to do with the Meng family directly.

07:57.281 --> 07:58.310
They don't need to harm me.

08:00.250 --> 08:01.051
Zhai Miao.

08:01.721 --> 08:03.121
What happened in the past is in the past.

08:03.351 --> 08:04.221
As for now,

08:04.921 --> 08:06.250
we haven't gotten to the bottom of this yet.

08:06.890 --> 08:08.250
Why use a bunch of assumptions...

08:08.351 --> 08:09.760
to trouble yourself?

08:12.190 --> 08:12.991
Sooner or later,

08:13.991 --> 08:15.801
there will be a fair result for this matter.

08:18.031 --> 08:18.830
I believe that.

09:11.150 --> 09:12.321
Why are you here?

09:15.461 --> 09:16.961
Wufang Street will be demolished soon.

09:17.861 --> 09:18.991
I want to see it more.

09:20.130 --> 09:21.390
You can't hide things from me.

09:24.130 --> 09:25.101
Doesn't your work...

09:25.170 --> 09:26.530
usually forbid drinking?

09:27.601 --> 09:28.331
What's wrong?

09:38.311 --> 09:39.410
I'm temporarily...

09:41.880 --> 09:42.721
suspended.

09:43.650 --> 09:44.451
You're suspended?

09:45.851 --> 09:46.920
Why?

09:47.351 --> 09:48.920
Is it because of Junguang?

09:51.020 --> 09:52.290
You did the right thing.

09:53.861 --> 09:55.461
First, someone gave me 200,000 yuan.

09:56.061 --> 09:56.831
Then the brigade...

09:56.900 --> 09:58.130
received a letter reporting...

09:58.630 --> 09:59.571
that I took a bribe...

10:00.371 --> 10:01.500
to defame Junguang Square...

10:01.571 --> 10:03.000
and say that there was a problem with the insulation materials.

10:14.311 --> 10:18.420
(Serve Yancheng, very disciplined, wise and brave in fighting)

10:31.300 --> 10:32.170
Pi Pi.

10:32.731 --> 10:33.731
How many have you had?

10:33.800 --> 10:34.471
Jiang Yi.

10:34.571 --> 10:35.441
Aren't you cold?

10:40.140 --> 10:40.941
Jiang Yi.

10:41.841 --> 10:42.941
After putting out a fire,

10:43.640 --> 10:45.280
Chief would buy me a popsicle every time.

10:46.581 --> 10:48.111
I feel panicked without him.

10:51.420 --> 10:52.250
When do you think...

10:52.550 --> 10:54.250
Chief can get his job back?

10:57.321 --> 10:58.461
We don't know that either.

11:01.491 --> 11:02.160
Jiang Yi.

11:03.300 --> 11:04.800
I've been dreaming about Da Peng for the past two days.

11:05.871 --> 11:07.800
Da Peng always said something to me.

11:09.000 --> 11:10.601
But why can't I remember it?

11:21.780 --> 11:22.520
That's enough.

11:23.550 --> 11:25.321
We all miss Da Peng.

11:27.621 --> 11:28.721
It's time to get off work.

11:29.520 --> 11:30.191
Wash up.

11:30.660 --> 11:31.361
Get some rest.

11:31.660 --> 11:32.991
Look at your face.

11:36.861 --> 11:37.930
Don't think too much.

11:41.371 --> 11:42.101
Yang Chi.

11:42.441 --> 11:43.241
I remember now.

11:45.410 --> 11:46.211
Da Peng said...

11:46.441 --> 11:47.471
17.48 seconds.

11:49.981 --> 11:50.981
17.48 seconds?

11:51.811 --> 11:52.611
What does that mean?

11:54.111 --> 11:55.851
He said he beat Chief in the 100m hurdle.

11:58.550 --> 12:00.050
He even beat Chief.

12:01.221 --> 12:03.361
But why couldn't he beat the fire?

12:28.920 --> 12:30.650
Have you considered changing your profession?

12:35.150 --> 12:36.020
To be honest,

12:38.191 --> 12:39.361
I thought about it at first.

12:41.260 --> 12:42.061
But later on...

12:47.400 --> 12:49.000
I didn't think that much at first.

12:50.341 --> 12:51.800
It was just a job.

12:53.071 --> 12:54.540
Training every day is tough.

12:56.040 --> 12:57.081
When there's a fire,

12:58.040 --> 12:59.180
I'll do my best.

13:00.481 --> 13:01.780
I think this kind of life...

13:02.880 --> 13:03.851
is quite simple.

13:05.050 --> 13:06.150
I don't have much worries.

13:08.890 --> 13:10.020
But gradually,

13:11.091 --> 13:12.331
being a firefighter...

13:12.390 --> 13:14.331
became more than just a job to me.

13:15.660 --> 13:17.260
It's also half of my life.

13:21.331 --> 13:22.341
These clothes...

13:25.000 --> 13:26.371
have also become a part of me.

13:29.140 --> 13:30.280
I can't leave them anymore.

13:36.680 --> 13:37.650
I hope...

13:37.721 --> 13:38.920
they will get to the bottom of this soon,

13:39.851 --> 13:40.920
so you can clear your name...

13:41.290 --> 13:42.861
and give an explanation for Da Peng's death.

13:43.760 --> 13:44.691
I also hope...

13:46.731 --> 13:48.191
that you can go back to work soon...

13:49.361 --> 13:50.361
and work...

13:51.331 --> 13:52.371
9 to 5 daily...

13:53.601 --> 13:54.500
and be safe.

14:43.081 --> 14:44.250
Insufficient balance.

14:44.750 --> 14:45.691
How much more do I need?

14:46.020 --> 14:47.121
Over 20,000 yuan.

14:49.461 --> 14:50.660
Over 20,000 yuan?

14:50.760 --> 14:51.861
Come back when you have it.

14:52.091 --> 14:53.591
There's a long queue behind you.

14:55.930 --> 14:56.861
I'm sorry.

14:57.601 --> 14:58.530
I won't pay first.

15:00.601 --> 15:01.371
Okay, next.

15:05.241 --> 15:05.910
Mom.

15:05.971 --> 15:07.170
It's not that we won't treat him.

15:07.741 --> 15:09.180
There's really no other way.

15:09.640 --> 15:12.581
Why is Li Da Long's life so hard?

15:16.650 --> 15:17.920
The small amount of compensation...

15:18.351 --> 15:19.550
is all used up.

15:20.290 --> 15:21.951
The small amount I saved up is also gone.

15:22.721 --> 15:23.890
When I was trying to pay earlier,

15:25.121 --> 15:26.991
the doctor said I was over 20,000 yuan short.

15:27.461 --> 15:29.900
Where am I going to get over 20,000 yuan?

15:32.000 --> 15:34.500
We shouldn't have signed the agreement with them back then...

15:34.571 --> 15:36.000
and take the hush money.

15:36.300 --> 15:38.201
He's not even cured yet...

15:38.270 --> 15:39.871
and they don't care about him anymore.

15:39.941 --> 15:41.871
I really don't know what to do.

15:41.941 --> 15:43.140
Mom.

15:48.880 --> 15:50.821
I really don't know what to do.

15:58.691 --> 15:59.390
Mom.

15:59.530 --> 16:00.231
Mom.

16:08.300 --> 16:09.741
Mom, what are you doing?

16:11.170 --> 16:12.540
Why are you packing the clothes?

16:14.770 --> 16:15.841
We don't have money for treatment.

16:17.540 --> 16:18.910
Let's transfer your dad to our hometown.

16:19.510 --> 16:20.211
The nurse said...

16:20.280 --> 16:21.550
the fees had been paid.

16:21.611 --> 16:23.280
We can proceed with the treatment.

16:32.691 --> 16:33.361
Look.

16:45.170 --> 16:45.971
Who paid for it?

16:46.770 --> 16:48.211
Dr. Xu did.

16:54.111 --> 16:55.581
Our family can be saved.

16:56.780 --> 16:57.951
Your dad can be saved.

17:06.331 --> 17:07.660
Our family can be saved.

17:11.900 --> 17:13.400
Your dad can be saved.

17:18.640 --> 17:19.511
(Surgery level: High, Surgery part: Chest, Anesthesia method: General)

17:19.571 --> 17:20.541
(Pre-op diagnosis: Burn complication Surgery: Pulmonary edema surgery)

17:22.740 --> 17:26.581
(Operation time)

17:26.650 --> 17:27.950
(Family, No entry)

17:29.521 --> 17:30.521
Li Da Long's family.

17:32.551 --> 17:33.351
Coming.

17:34.751 --> 17:35.490
The surgery went very well.

17:35.551 --> 17:36.291
Don't worry.

17:37.690 --> 17:38.361
Thank you.

17:41.190 --> 17:42.261
Excuse me.

17:42.660 --> 17:43.561
Where's Dr. Xu?

17:43.700 --> 17:44.561
Dr. Xu?

17:45.001 --> 17:46.331
Dr. Xu has already left.

17:47.001 --> 17:47.801
Thank you.

17:49.140 --> 17:49.900
Da Long.

18:05.751 --> 18:06.490
Dr. Xu.

18:07.251 --> 18:08.450
How is he feeling today?

18:08.920 --> 18:09.890
He's good.

18:10.091 --> 18:11.021
But he woke up in the middle of the night...

18:11.091 --> 18:11.990
due to the pain.

18:12.490 --> 18:13.460
Don't worry too much.

18:13.861 --> 18:14.630
Post-surgery pain...

18:14.690 --> 18:16.331
is short-lived and common.

18:16.861 --> 18:17.561
Feng Bei.

18:18.331 --> 18:19.371
If the pain is severe,

18:19.430 --> 18:20.400
give him a painkiller injection.

18:21.771 --> 18:22.801
Thank you, Dr. Xu.

18:23.200 --> 18:24.001
Don't mention it.

18:24.670 --> 18:25.571
You should thank...

18:25.640 --> 18:27.071
those firefighters.

18:27.371 --> 18:28.640
They were the ones who saved his life.

18:30.081 --> 18:31.140
By the way, Dr. Xu,

18:31.380 --> 18:33.251
what happened to that young man who saved Da Long?

18:33.311 --> 18:34.251
Is he all right?

18:41.251 --> 18:42.220
He died.

18:49.700 --> 18:50.861
He died?

18:57.470 --> 18:59.271
That guy is still so young.

19:06.480 --> 19:07.480
Take good care of him.

19:07.710 --> 19:09.081
Ring the bell if you need anything.

19:10.621 --> 19:11.321
Let's go.

19:25.831 --> 19:26.630
Dr. Xu.

19:29.341 --> 19:30.200
You go ahead.

19:33.740 --> 19:34.541
Dr. Xu.

19:35.470 --> 19:37.380
I heard you know someone from the fire department.

19:38.611 --> 19:39.781
There's something...

19:41.410 --> 19:42.380
I want to tell you.

19:49.920 --> 19:50.690
Open the door.

19:56.301 --> 19:56.960
Open it.

19:59.371 --> 20:00.031
Hurry up.

20:00.101 --> 20:00.930
Load them up and take them away.

20:01.001 --> 20:01.831
Go.

20:23.960 --> 20:25.190
Come on, hurry up.

20:29.801 --> 20:30.601
Let's go.

20:30.861 --> 20:31.561
The police!

20:42.680 --> 20:43.480
Police!

20:44.240 --> 20:44.980
Get off the vehicle.

20:46.950 --> 20:49.351
(Public Security)

20:49.420 --> 20:50.220
Stand still.

20:52.521 --> 20:54.021
The preliminary cause of the fire at Junguang Square...

20:54.091 --> 20:55.220
has been confirmed.

20:55.291 --> 20:56.490
The project manager, Mr. Zhao,

20:56.561 --> 20:57.920
set off fireworks illegally.

20:57.990 --> 20:59.430
Sparks ignited on the 12th floor,

20:59.490 --> 21:00.791
stacked on the 12th floor,

21:00.861 --> 21:02.361
causing a major fire.

21:02.430 --> 21:03.101
Mr. Wang,

21:03.160 --> 21:04.361
the secretary of Guokun Group's board of directors,

21:04.430 --> 21:05.230
colluded with Mr. Zhao...

21:05.301 --> 21:06.771
to use low-quality insulation materials...

21:06.831 --> 21:08.700
and sell them at top-quality prices to make a profit.

21:08.771 --> 21:11.170
They also illegally avoided the fire inspection.

21:11.400 --> 21:12.811
They are now in criminal custody...

21:12.871 --> 21:13.970
by the Public Safety Agency.

21:14.140 --> 21:15.880
The case is currently undergoing further investigation.

21:15.940 --> 21:18.480
Please stay tuned to our station for updates.

21:19.380 --> 21:20.351
(Party loyalty, strict discipline)

21:20.410 --> 21:21.680
Your report...

21:22.581 --> 21:24.851
is highly acknowledged by the Investigation Team.

21:26.150 --> 21:27.251
In terms of fire-related matters,

21:27.650 --> 21:28.851
Junguang Square...

21:28.920 --> 21:31.091
committed falsification indeed.

21:31.361 --> 21:33.990
In terms of fire inspection,

21:34.390 --> 21:36.001
we must improve ourselves.

21:38.301 --> 21:39.771
Your bribery charge...

21:40.700 --> 21:41.970
is a complete frame-up.

21:42.331 --> 21:43.541
We got to the bottom of it.

21:46.240 --> 21:47.371
In this fire incident,

21:47.440 --> 21:49.140
you made a contribution to putting out the fire...

21:49.680 --> 21:50.781
and have been wronged too.

21:51.680 --> 21:52.650
If you have any difficulties,

21:52.710 --> 21:53.511
you can tell us.

22:02.660 --> 22:03.621
I only have one request.

22:04.690 --> 22:05.591
I hope the brigade...

22:06.091 --> 22:07.660
can take care of Zhan Da Peng's parents.

22:08.660 --> 22:09.801
He's their only son.

22:10.730 --> 22:11.430
Don't worry.

22:12.361 --> 22:13.230
Don't worry about this.

22:13.970 --> 22:14.630
Regarding this matter,

22:15.700 --> 22:17.841
we'll do our best to take care of it.

22:21.611 --> 22:22.811
Thank you, Dr. Li.

22:26.311 --> 22:28.081
Why are you so not proactive in your treatment?

22:28.380 --> 22:30.121
No. I've been too busy lately.

22:30.180 --> 22:30.851
You know that.

22:30.920 --> 22:32.751
Besides, we thought the treatment was done.

22:32.821 --> 22:34.521
Yes, the treatment for those who weren't seriously injured...

22:34.591 --> 22:35.690
is done.

22:35.890 --> 22:36.861
Didn't I tell those who were seriously injured like you...

22:36.920 --> 22:38.061
to come more often?

22:38.121 --> 22:39.291
Why can't you understand?

22:39.490 --> 22:40.230
It's my mistake.

22:40.291 --> 22:41.130
I'll come on time in the future.

22:41.361 --> 22:42.730
- My bad. - All right, stop talking.

22:49.640 --> 22:50.541
Have you inhaled it?

22:52.771 --> 22:53.740
Have you?

22:53.811 --> 22:54.740
Say something.

22:55.541 --> 22:56.210
I inhaled it.

22:56.281 --> 22:57.611
You don't want me to talk, right?

23:00.511 --> 23:02.450
Don't be mad. I'll go to you later when I'm done.

23:07.121 --> 23:07.851
Dr. Li.

23:10.291 --> 23:10.960
Thank you.

23:27.440 --> 23:31.210
("The Bravest" movie ticket)

23:40.420 --> 23:41.091
Mom.

23:41.551 --> 23:42.220
Dad.

23:43.321 --> 23:45.091
I've done something you all can be proud of this time.

24:08.251 --> 24:10.650
Well, that Pan Pan sticker is pretty cute.

24:11.650 --> 24:12.950
Does it feel any different?

24:14.021 --> 24:14.821
It's almost the same.

24:14.950 --> 24:16.160
I'm still serving the people.

24:21.331 --> 24:22.190
You've lost weight.

24:22.261 --> 24:23.561
Have you not been resting well lately?

24:25.130 --> 24:26.400
You're so concerned about me.

24:27.170 --> 24:28.900
I'm afraid you'd cause me trouble.

24:30.140 --> 24:31.001
Thank you, Ms. Nan.

24:31.640 --> 24:32.371
Take care.

24:32.440 --> 24:33.140
Okay.

24:39.680 --> 24:40.781
I accept your test.

24:41.081 --> 24:42.111
I'll wait for your good news.

24:54.591 --> 24:55.761
I'll surely win.

24:57.301 --> 24:58.230
The rest of you,

24:58.801 --> 24:59.601
stay where you are and await orders.

25:00.331 --> 25:02.170
If the comrades in front of you fail,

25:02.371 --> 25:03.200
those behind them...

25:03.501 --> 25:04.470
must make it up for them even if you die.

25:04.541 --> 25:05.271
- Yes! - Yes!

25:10.380 --> 25:11.440
We'll get the job done.

25:21.521 --> 25:22.420
Yang Chi.

25:22.621 --> 25:23.291
Present.

25:23.621 --> 25:24.361
Jiang Yi.

25:24.420 --> 25:25.091
