25:28.390 --> 25:29.061
Present.

25:29.900 --> 25:30.601
Wang Lin.

25:30.730 --> 25:31.400
Present.

25:31.561 --> 25:32.400
Li Cheng Shuo.

25:32.501 --> 25:33.170
Present.

25:33.400 --> 25:34.071
Wang Bin.

25:34.130 --> 25:34.831
Present.

25:35.571 --> 25:36.240
Fu Lei.

25:36.371 --> 25:37.041
Present.

25:37.101 --> 25:37.771
Shao Qiang.

25:37.900 --> 25:38.571
Present.

25:38.970 --> 25:39.640
Li Cheng.

25:39.710 --> 25:40.371
Present.

25:40.640 --> 25:41.410
Wang Han Xiang.

25:41.470 --> 25:42.140
Present.

25:42.341 --> 25:43.210
Wu Yong Xin.

25:43.281 --> 25:43.940
Present.

25:44.440 --> 25:45.210
Liu Jun Kai.

25:45.341 --> 25:46.081
Present.

25:46.581 --> 25:47.410
Li Xin Ming.

25:47.511 --> 25:48.180
Present.

25:49.410 --> 25:50.420
Liu Jun Ping.

25:50.480 --> 25:51.150
Present.

25:51.680 --> 25:52.720
Pi Shao Jie.

25:52.851 --> 25:53.521
Present.

25:54.220 --> 25:54.890
Ge Zheng.

25:55.121 --> 25:55.851
Present.

25:59.261 --> 26:00.361
Zhan Da Peng.

26:10.970 --> 26:14.740
(Serve Yancheng, very disciplined, wise and brave in fighting)

27:29.821 --> 27:30.920
Zhan Da Peng.

27:31.021 --> 27:32.480
- Present! - Present!

27:38.121 --> 27:39.660
Zhan Da Peng!

27:39.930 --> 27:41.660
- Present! - Present!

27:44.200 --> 27:45.301
Zhan Da Peng!

27:46.400 --> 27:47.970
- Present! - Present!

28:23.640 --> 28:24.440
Thank you.

28:26.140 --> 28:26.970
Mr. Meng.

28:27.071 --> 28:28.140
You're back.

28:29.680 --> 28:30.841
Did Qin Qin not come home?

28:30.910 --> 28:31.581
No.

28:31.640 --> 28:33.281
She's on emergency duty tonight.

28:34.051 --> 28:35.980
The hospital is so busy.

28:40.490 --> 28:41.551
We treat her...

28:41.950 --> 28:43.121
as our precious daughter.

28:43.460 --> 28:44.490
But what about her?

28:45.990 --> 28:46.890
This matter...

28:47.061 --> 28:48.061
must have gotten to this point...

28:49.490 --> 28:50.831
because Song Yan...

28:50.900 --> 28:52.331
is fanning the flames.

28:53.730 --> 28:54.501
Mom.

28:55.101 --> 28:56.200
Regarding this matter,

28:56.571 --> 28:57.970
Qin Qin and I have the same view.

28:58.970 --> 29:00.341
That's his duty.

29:10.851 --> 29:11.720
Based on this incident,

29:11.781 --> 29:13.051
we can see...

29:13.490 --> 29:16.720
that he has no consideration for our family at all.

29:18.291 --> 29:20.531
If Qin Qin insists on being with him,

29:21.160 --> 29:22.091
does that mean...

29:22.390 --> 29:24.101
she doesn't want this family anymore?

29:24.361 --> 29:25.301
Don't say that.

29:25.630 --> 29:26.630
She won't do that.

29:33.740 --> 29:34.571
What happened this time...

29:36.271 --> 29:38.210
is because Mr. Gu's subordinate didn't do a good job indeed.

29:38.380 --> 29:39.611
That's why this big disaster happened.

29:40.511 --> 29:41.680
Be it a crime or a responsibility,

29:42.311 --> 29:43.081
we have to accept it.

29:44.950 --> 29:46.690
Those who must be punished have already been punished now.

29:47.490 --> 29:48.220
Fortunately,

29:49.091 --> 29:50.761
the company wasn't badly damaged.

29:54.531 --> 29:55.990
Because of what happened,

29:56.160 --> 29:56.930
doesn't Mr. Gu...

29:57.001 --> 29:59.361
have much say in the company anymore?

29:59.531 --> 30:00.970
He didn't manage his subordinates well.

30:01.730 --> 30:02.930
He's responsible for that.

30:12.710 --> 30:13.611
Yan Chen.

30:14.111 --> 30:16.210
When can you take over your dad's position?

30:16.521 --> 30:17.720
Look at the current situation.

30:17.781 --> 30:18.920
It's getting more complicated.

30:19.450 --> 30:21.220
Your dad's health isn't what it used to be.

30:21.690 --> 30:22.650
He can't control...

30:22.821 --> 30:24.061
what he used to either.

30:24.660 --> 30:26.591
Until when are you going to stay...

30:26.660 --> 30:28.390
in that lousy and tiny company?

30:31.730 --> 30:32.700
And Qin Qin.

30:34.801 --> 30:36.900
You should also discipline her well.

30:36.970 --> 30:37.771
I'm serious.

30:40.970 --> 30:43.240
Both of these two kids are worrisome.

30:44.480 --> 30:45.680
We'll go ahead, Dr. Xu.

30:48.851 --> 30:50.351
(Contacts, Dad, Bo Bo, Mr. Chen)

31:00.061 --> 31:00.730
Hello.

31:01.361 --> 31:02.190
Hello, Dad.

31:02.791 --> 31:03.561
Qin Qin.

31:03.761 --> 31:04.561
Are you...

31:05.430 --> 31:06.430
already off work?

31:07.170 --> 31:08.200
Have you eaten?

31:09.230 --> 31:10.101
I have.

31:10.501 --> 31:11.440
I'm off work too.

31:12.170 --> 31:13.611
I just wanted to call you.

31:17.341 --> 31:18.581
How have you been lately?

31:21.210 --> 31:22.251
I'm good.

31:22.710 --> 31:23.420
What about you?

31:24.281 --> 31:25.621
How's your health?

31:26.920 --> 31:27.751
Do you keep...

31:28.121 --> 31:29.821
your hypertension medicine with you often?

31:31.061 --> 31:31.890
Don't worry too much...

31:33.061 --> 31:34.490
about the company.

31:37.801 --> 31:39.230
I got it.

31:39.970 --> 31:40.771
Don't worry.

31:41.601 --> 31:42.271
I...

31:43.541 --> 31:44.640
I'm fine.

31:46.341 --> 31:47.440
What happened at the company...

31:47.640 --> 31:48.970
doesn't affect you much, right?

31:50.180 --> 31:51.180
How should I put it?

31:52.640 --> 31:53.980
It actually doesn't really affect me.

31:55.011 --> 31:55.980
Don't worry about it.

31:56.621 --> 31:57.380
You...

31:58.021 --> 31:59.021
should work hard.

31:59.621 --> 32:00.551
Take care of yourself.

32:00.950 --> 32:02.490
Come home often.

32:03.561 --> 32:04.490
I will.

32:05.720 --> 32:06.990
I'll go ahead then, Dad.

32:23.180 --> 32:24.811
Regarding your future work arrangements,

32:25.140 --> 32:27.251
the party committee has already discussed it.

32:27.450 --> 32:29.851
But we still want to hear your own opinion.

32:32.121 --> 32:33.420
You have two options.

32:33.751 --> 32:35.890
First, transfer to the brigade.

32:36.121 --> 32:37.121
As for the other one...

32:41.190 --> 32:42.160
See for yourself.

32:54.041 --> 32:55.541
You don't have to decide now.

32:56.410 --> 32:57.240
Think about it for a few days.

32:57.740 --> 32:58.640
Think about it for a few days.

33:02.311 --> 33:05.150
Given that Shilitai Fire and Rescue Station...

33:05.220 --> 33:07.051
of Yanbei District's Fire Brigade...

33:07.351 --> 33:10.861
fully played an advanced and standard demonstrative role...

33:11.321 --> 33:13.690
in protecting the lives and properties...

33:13.761 --> 33:16.531
of the people of Yancheng,

33:17.061 --> 33:18.101
didn't forget their original intention,

33:18.160 --> 33:19.430
remember their mission,

33:19.700 --> 33:21.031
have effectively prevented...

33:21.400 --> 33:23.130
major fire accidents,

33:23.640 --> 33:25.871
and made outstanding contributions...

33:26.001 --> 33:28.341
to protect the city's economic development...

33:28.410 --> 33:30.640
and the safety of people's lives and properties,

33:31.041 --> 33:33.450
based on the brigade's investigation, we've decided...

33:34.011 --> 33:35.811
to request the establishment...

33:36.051 --> 33:38.680
of Shilitai Fire and Rescue Response Station.

33:39.121 --> 33:40.351
Please approve it.

33:55.301 --> 33:55.970
Ms. Lian.

33:56.331 --> 33:57.001
Mr. Gao.

33:57.341 --> 33:58.271
I've made up my mind.

33:58.601 --> 33:59.601
I'm staying at Shilitai...

33:59.970 --> 34:01.170
to accept this challenge.

34:02.871 --> 34:04.041
I guessed right, didn't I?

34:05.140 --> 34:09.180
(Serve Yancheng, very disciplined)

34:09.251 --> 34:16.860
(Always the loyal defender of the party and people)

34:16.921 --> 34:17.621
Today...

34:18.090 --> 34:19.561
is the 30th anniversary...

34:20.590 --> 34:22.760
of the founding of Shilitai Fire Station.

34:23.061 --> 34:24.760
Thank you all for coming.

34:26.131 --> 34:27.030
Please welcome...

34:27.601 --> 34:28.800
Commissar Lian Jie...

34:29.171 --> 34:29.831
for her speech.

34:37.081 --> 34:38.041
Today...

34:38.481 --> 34:40.550
is the 30th anniversary...

34:40.610 --> 34:43.010
of the founding of Shilitai Fire and Rescue Station.

34:43.680 --> 34:44.820
In the past 30 years,

34:45.450 --> 34:47.090
Shilitai Fire and Rescue Station...

34:47.291 --> 34:48.820
has grown...

34:48.890 --> 34:50.521
and received honor.

34:51.320 --> 34:52.421
For the past 30 years,

34:52.760 --> 34:55.291
Shilitai has been dispatched...

34:55.360 --> 34:56.930
a total of over 350,000 times.

34:57.501 --> 34:59.860
It rescued and evacuated...

34:59.930 --> 35:01.200
over 170,000 trapped people.

35:01.631 --> 35:03.030
It protected over one billion yuan's worth...

35:03.101 --> 35:04.601
of people's properties.

35:05.401 --> 35:07.541
The firefighters of Shilitai...

35:07.610 --> 35:09.140
have advanced wave after wave,

35:09.211 --> 35:10.581
never forgetting their original intentions,

35:10.640 --> 35:11.840
and don't fear hardships.

35:12.780 --> 35:14.151
You didn't fail...

35:14.211 --> 35:16.211
the firefighter's emblem on your heads...

35:16.280 --> 35:17.921
and the trust of the people.

35:25.360 --> 35:26.160
Down.

35:31.160 --> 35:32.200
Let's welcome...

35:32.760 --> 35:34.331
the leader of the municipal committee for his speech.

35:40.001 --> 35:40.970
Comrades.

35:41.771 --> 35:44.441
Shilitai's firefighters...

35:45.041 --> 35:46.581
use their flesh and blood...

35:46.640 --> 35:48.050
and strong spirit...

35:48.450 --> 35:50.220
to protect this city...

35:50.651 --> 35:51.381
and become...

35:51.521 --> 35:54.291
the well-deserved defenders of this city.

35:54.421 --> 35:56.760
To pass on and promote...

35:57.260 --> 35:58.590
the spirit of rescuing...

35:58.660 --> 36:00.660
and proactive will...

36:00.890 --> 36:02.061
of Shilitai Fire Station...

36:02.131 --> 36:03.800
for 30 years...

36:04.731 --> 36:07.800
and to thank each and every one...

36:08.001 --> 36:10.300
of the firefighters here...

36:10.371 --> 36:12.970
who quietly contribute to this city,

36:13.171 --> 36:15.171
the municipal committee and municipal government...

36:15.240 --> 36:16.410
have decided...

36:16.671 --> 36:19.340
to award Shilitai Fire Station...

36:19.680 --> 36:22.711
the title of "Yancheng's Defender".

36:27.651 --> 36:28.450
Comrades.

36:29.251 --> 36:30.121
In this new time...

36:30.720 --> 36:31.890
and new era,

36:32.260 --> 36:33.530
we're facing...

36:33.791 --> 36:36.360
a new mission and a new challenge.

36:37.001 --> 36:37.660
Next,

36:38.001 --> 36:39.030
under the leadership...

36:39.101 --> 36:40.371
of the municipal committee,

36:40.430 --> 36:42.371
the municipal government,

36:42.731 --> 36:44.070
and the headquarters,

36:44.140 --> 36:45.740
we will continue to optimize...

36:46.401 --> 36:47.140
our firefighting team...

36:47.340 --> 36:48.671
and strive...

36:48.740 --> 36:49.811
to turn...

36:50.140 --> 36:50.840
Shilitai Fire and Rescue Station...

36:51.211 --> 36:52.340
into a response station.

36:54.510 --> 36:56.410
Based on the standard...

36:56.680 --> 36:58.220
of creating an emergency rescue team,

36:58.450 --> 37:01.720
a national team, and a main force,

37:02.121 --> 37:04.390
we'll become the sharpest one...

37:04.461 --> 37:05.590
among the rescue teams.

37:07.061 --> 37:08.291
Are you confident?

37:08.461 --> 37:09.390
- Yes! - Yes!

37:09.791 --> 37:10.700
Good.

37:11.930 --> 37:12.601
Song Yan.

37:12.760 --> 37:13.430
Present.

37:13.501 --> 37:14.171
Come on stage.

37:14.231 --> 37:14.901
Yes, sir.

37:14.970 --> 37:17.700
(Shilitai Fire and Rescue Station's 30th anniversary)

37:17.771 --> 37:20.541
(Awarding Ceremony for the title of "Yancheng's Defender")

37:30.921 --> 37:31.581
Song Yan.

37:32.720 --> 37:33.621
This is a military merit medal...

37:34.490 --> 37:35.921
and a military order.

37:36.490 --> 37:38.090
Take it.

37:38.360 --> 37:39.561
Protect it.

37:40.090 --> 37:40.760
Yes.

37:41.831 --> 37:42.490
Please go ahead.

37:42.561 --> 37:43.731
(Yancheng's Defender)

37:46.530 --> 37:47.231
Thank you.

