Party loyalty.

37:56.140 --> 37:57.541
- Party loyalty. - Party loyalty.

37:57.610 --> 37:59.041
- Strict discipline. - Strict discipline.

37:59.240 --> 38:00.550
- Defy danger and death. - Defy danger and death.

38:00.610 --> 38:02.251
- Dedicated to the people. - Dedicated to the people.

