- Defy danger and death. - Defy danger and death.

38:13.561 --> 38:15.260
- Dedicated to the people. - Dedicated to the people.

38:15.731 --> 38:21.631
(Always the loyal defender of the party and people)

38:21.700 --> 38:25.640
(You miss a city because someone you miss is there)

38:45.860 --> 38:46.590
You're back.

38:47.260 --> 38:48.191
Aren't you on the night shift?

38:48.791 --> 38:49.731
I changed shifts.

38:50.331 --> 38:51.131
You're back just in time.

38:51.961 --> 38:53.160
Are you craving fish with pickled vegetables?

38:53.570 --> 38:54.530
I'll cook it right away.

38:56.231 --> 38:57.740
When are you going to work at the brigade?

39:01.941 --> 39:03.240
Wasn't the transfer order already issued?

39:07.811 --> 39:08.711
It was.

39:14.691 --> 39:15.851
So are you going or not?

39:20.291 --> 39:21.260
I've decided...

39:22.590 --> 39:23.760
to stay at Shilitai.

39:26.101 --> 39:26.800
At first,

39:27.570 --> 39:28.631
I did want to go to the brigade indeed.

39:29.231 --> 39:31.140
But now, Shilitai has been upgraded.

39:31.541 --> 39:32.740
Our equipment and staff...

39:33.070 --> 39:34.271
have been moved up a level.

39:36.640 --> 39:37.381
In the future,

39:38.211 --> 39:39.441
things will surely get better.

39:42.180 --> 39:43.251
Actually, I'm very conflicted.

39:44.621 --> 39:46.251
I've thought about it for days...

39:47.651 --> 39:48.351
before I made my decision.

39:49.851 --> 39:50.860
Why did you feel conflicted?

39:51.490 --> 39:52.421
Is it because of me?

39:55.390 --> 39:56.291
Are you afraid...

39:56.360 --> 39:57.461
that I'll hold you back?

39:58.860 --> 39:59.530
No.

39:59.601 --> 40:00.930
In making such an important decision,

40:01.001 --> 40:02.401
why didn't you discuss it with me?

40:03.101 --> 40:03.771
I...

40:09.671 --> 40:10.941
I was afraid you'd feel pressured.

40:12.381 --> 40:13.311
I was also afraid that you'd be mature...

40:13.381 --> 40:14.410
and choose to support me...

40:15.510 --> 40:16.680
but end up suffering.

40:18.921 --> 40:20.751
So you always choose not to tell me.

40:32.030 --> 40:32.760
I'm sorry.

40:33.731 --> 40:34.831
I didn't think it through.

40:36.300 --> 40:37.371
I'm not saying this...

40:38.041 --> 40:39.470
to make excuses for myself.

40:40.811 --> 40:41.671
However,

40:42.740 --> 40:43.811
I don't know why.

40:44.081 --> 40:45.441
In the face of pressure,

40:46.381 --> 40:47.381
I always want to bear it alone.

40:48.581 --> 40:49.711
I don't want to transfer it to you.

40:50.421 --> 40:51.121
Indeed.

40:52.280 --> 40:53.651
When you're under pressure,

40:54.121 --> 40:56.521
the first thing you think of isn't asking me to bear it with you.

40:57.461 --> 40:58.820
Instead, you choose to hide it from me.

41:00.561 --> 41:02.291
You think that's good for me,

41:02.731 --> 41:03.700
so I wouldn't have to worry.

41:04.760 --> 41:06.430
You've always been like this.

41:07.501 --> 41:08.401
You didn't tell me you were suspended.

41:09.231 --> 41:10.740
You didn't tell me you weren't going to work at the brigade.

41:10.800 --> 41:12.601
What do you take me for?

41:13.041 --> 41:14.811
I didn't mean to hide it from you.

41:15.340 --> 41:16.470
I have nothing to hide either.

41:16.541 --> 41:17.840
Then how did you get shot?

41:17.910 --> 41:18.840
Tell me.

41:22.811 --> 41:24.581
Why didn't you do well when you retook the exam?

41:25.081 --> 41:26.421
Why did you join the army?

41:27.220 --> 41:29.151
And why did you become a firefighter?

41:30.561 --> 41:32.820
Why do Zhai Miao, Uncle, and Aunt know,

41:32.890 --> 41:34.461
but I can't know these things?

41:41.401 --> 41:42.800
I just want to know the truth.

41:44.340 --> 41:45.700
Or you can give me an explanation.

41:51.981 --> 41:53.640
There are many things that have no truth...

41:54.610 --> 41:56.010
and can't be explained.

42:08.191 --> 42:09.331
Is this your attitude?

42:09.791 --> 42:10.501
I...

42:22.470 --> 42:23.371
Xu Qin.

42:24.410 --> 42:25.441
I've really...

42:26.640 --> 42:28.651
never lied to you.

42:29.211 --> 42:30.280
Trust me.

42:30.851 --> 42:32.081
I'll never hurt you.

42:32.151 --> 42:32.950
Trust me.

42:33.021 --> 42:34.590
- Okay? - You've already hurt me.

42:34.651 --> 42:37.021
There shouldn't be any secrets between us.

42:40.191 --> 42:41.331
Now, I feel like...

42:42.131 --> 42:44.461
you've excluded me from a lot of things.

42:45.561 --> 42:47.501
It's like I'm not your family.

42:48.300 --> 42:49.901
How can I not treat you as a family?

42:50.771 --> 42:51.771
You're the most important family member...

42:51.840 --> 42:53.271
to me in this world, don't you know that?

42:53.340 --> 42:55.171
Then tell me. What exactly is going on?

42:56.041 --> 42:56.811
Fine.

42:57.481 --> 42:58.881
Even if you don't want to tell me now,

42:59.010 --> 43:00.240
you have to give me a reason.

43:00.311 --> 43:01.381
Why won't you tell me?

43:02.010 --> 43:03.311
I don't know how to tell you.
